  "ingredients": [
    "12 ounce pork tenderloin",
    "16 ounce asparagus spears (rinsed + trimmed)",
    "1/4 cup butter (softened)",
    "2 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced + divided)",
    "1/4 cup chicken broth",
    "1/2 medium lemon (juice of)",
    "1 teaspoon crushed red pepper flakes",
    "1 teaspoon italian seasoning",
    "2 teaspoon onion powder",
    "1 teaspoon paprika",
    "1 teaspoon cayenne pepper",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients. Dice the raw pork.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/garlic-butter-pork-with-lemon-asparagus/#wprm-recipe-53909-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Garlic-Butter-Pork-with-Lemon-Asparagus-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, add the diced pork to a bowl. Season it with half of the minced garlic, crushed red pepper flakes, onion powder, paprika, cayenne pepper, Italian seasoning, and salt and pepper. Toss to combine.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/garlic-butter-pork-with-lemon-asparagus/#wprm-recipe-53909-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Garlic-Butter-Pork-with-Lemon-Asparagus-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a frying pan on medium to high heat, add softened butter and diced pork tenderloin to the pan and cook thoroughly until the internal temperature reaches 165F.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/garlic-butter-pork-with-lemon-asparagus/#wprm-recipe-53909-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Garlic-Butter-Pork-with-Lemon-Asparagus-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "When cooked thoroughly, remove from pan but leave the pork fat in the pan to cook the asparagus.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/garlic-butter-pork-with-lemon-asparagus/#wprm-recipe-53909-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Garlic-Butter-Pork-with-Lemon-Asparagus-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the chicken broth to the pan.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/garlic-butter-pork-with-lemon-asparagus/#wprm-recipe-53909-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Garlic-Butter-Pork-with-Lemon-Asparagus-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Squeeze a lemon into the pan and let the juices dissolve.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/garlic-butter-pork-with-lemon-asparagus/#wprm-recipe-53909-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Garlic-Butter-Pork-with-Lemon-Asparagus-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the asparagus to the pan and let the spears cook for 3 - 5 minutes. Add the remaining minced garlic in with the asparagus.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/garlic-butter-pork-with-lemon-asparagus/#wprm-recipe-53909-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Garlic-Butter-Pork-with-Lemon-Asparagus-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then, add the pork bites back into the frying pan to get warm again.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/garlic-butter-pork-with-lemon-asparagus/#wprm-recipe-53909-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Garlic-Butter-Pork-with-Lemon-Asparagus-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/garlic-butter-pork-with-lemon-asparagus/#wprm-recipe-53909-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
